{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2SA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒母耳记下","commonName":"撒母耳记下","title":"撒母耳记下","order":10,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"6793e57d78aab8e763fdcd7b823538ed0ee7354b0cb1861e13c9e55350dc46e4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2SA/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":689},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大卫得知扫罗的死讯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大卫战胜了亚玛力人之后便回到洗革拉，在那里住了两天。那时扫罗已经死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第三天，有一个衣服撕裂、头蒙灰尘的人从扫罗军营中跑到大卫面前，俯伏下拜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大卫问他：“你从哪里来？”那人答道：“我是从以色列军营逃出来的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["大卫说：“请告诉我那边的情况。”他说：“以色列军溃逃，伤亡惨重，就连扫罗和他儿子约拿单都死了！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大卫又问报信的青年：“你怎么知道扫罗和他儿子约拿单死了？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["青年说：“我偶然到基利波山，看见扫罗在那里倚枪而立，敌人的战车骑兵紧紧追来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他回头看到我，便呼唤我。我说，‘我在这里。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他问我是什么人。我告诉他我是亚玛力人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["扫罗说他痛苦不堪，却又死不掉，要我杀了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我知道他身受重伤，必死无疑，就把他杀了，并取下他头上的王冠和臂上的镯子带来献给我主。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大卫就撕裂衣服，他的随从也撕裂衣服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们因扫罗、他的儿子约拿单和耶和华的子民以色列同胞阵亡而悲哀痛哭，禁食直到黄昏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["大卫又问报信的青年：“你是哪里的人？”他答道：“我是寄居在以色列的亚玛力人。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大卫说：“你怎么敢下手杀耶和华所膏立的王？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你是咎由自取！因为你亲口承认自己杀了耶和华所膏立的王。”大卫随即命令一个年轻的随从杀死他，随从便杀死了他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大卫的哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["大卫作了一首挽歌哀悼扫罗和他儿子约拿单，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["并吩咐人教导犹大人唱这首弓歌。这首歌记在《雅煞珥书》上，歌词说："]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你荣耀的王伏尸山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士竟然倒下！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在迦特宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在亚实基伦的街上传扬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得非利士的妇女幸灾乐祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得未受割礼之人的女子欢喜雀跃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"“基利波山啊，愿你没有雨露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的田地不长献祭用的五谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为那里有勇士锈污的盾牌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扫罗的盾牌没有抹油。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"“约拿单的弓射敌无数，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扫罗的剑不杀强敌不收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"“扫罗和约拿单深受爱戴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生死不分离。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们比鹰更敏捷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比狮子还强壮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"“以色列的女子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为扫罗哀哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他曾使你们衣服华美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿金戴银。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"“勇士竟战死沙场！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"约拿单竟伏尸山上！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的兄弟约拿单啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为你悲伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你对我情深义重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你对我的爱胜过女人的恋情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"“勇士竟然倒下！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兵器竟然耗损！”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2SA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2SA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1SA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}